      "description": "As a \nShopper,\nI want\n to view a size guide on the product page without leaving my browsing session,\nso that\n I can find the right size before adding to bag.\nImage for reference (Figma leading):\nFor products where Measmerize is not configured, clicking the Find My Size or Size Guide link opens an SFCC-owned size guide slide-out overlay. Content is managed in Contentful per product type and does not require a code deployment to update.\nThis story does not cover the Measmerize-powered size guide — see SFCC-101.",
